:8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":274.51,"default_fair_val":274.51,"premium_pct":60.3,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":25.8,"pe_forward":22.7,"pb_trailing":5.9,"pb_forward":5.3,"div_yield":1.27,"ps_ratio":6.4,"fcf_to_ev":4.63,"fcf_to_mcap":3.88,"liab_to_assets":66.9,"cash_to_assets":3.3,"current_ratio":1.61,"roe":23,"roa":7.6,"moat":{"ticker":"HUBB","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 在工業電氣設備領域擁有穩固的品牌聲譽，這使其在面對競爭時具備一定的定價能力。其產品線涵蓋從基礎設施到高端應用，品牌忠誠度在專業客戶群體中較高。然而，與消費品品牌相比，其品牌溢價空間相對有限，且在價格敏感的市場中仍需謹慎定價。整體而言，品牌是其重要的無形資產，但非絕對的壟斷壁壘。","comment_en":"Hubbell benefits from a strong brand reputation in the industrial electrical equipment sector, affording it a degree of pricing power against competitors. Its diverse product range, from basic infrastructure to high-end applications, fosters customer loyalty among professionals. However, compared to consumer brands, its pricing premium is more constrained, and it must remain price-conscious in competitive markets. The brand is a significant intangible asset but not an absolute monopolistic barrier."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 的專利和技術認證是其重要的競爭優勢，尤其是在特定細分市場，如高壓設備或特種連接器。這些技術壁壘能阻止競爭對手輕易模仿，並確保產品的可靠性和安全性。然而，工業設備領域的技術迭代相對較快，專利保護的時效性需要持續的研發投入來維持領先地位。監管認證雖然是進入門檻，但並非獨家優勢。","comment_en":"Hubbell's patents and technical certifications provide a notable competitive advantage, particularly in niche segments like high-voltage equipment or specialized connectors. These technological barriers deter easy imitation and ensure product reliability and safety. However, the industrial equipment sector sees relatively rapid technological evolution, requiring continuous R&D investment to maintain leadership. Regulatory certifications are entry barriers but not exclusive advantages."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"對於依賴 Hubbell 產品的工業客戶而言，更換供應商的轉換成本相對較高。這涉及到重新認證、系統集成、員工培訓以及對新產品性能的驗證。特別是在關鍵基礎設施和安全敏感的應用中，客戶傾向於維持與現有可靠供應商的長期合作關係。這種慣性為 Hubbell 提供了穩定的客戶基礎和收入來源。","comment_en":"For industrial clients relying on Hubbell's products, the cost of switching suppliers is considerable. This involves re-certification, system integration, employee training, and validation of new product performance. Especially in critical infrastructure and safety-sensitive applications, customers prefer to maintain long-term relationships with reliable existing suppliers. This inertia provides Hubbell with a stable customer base and revenue stream."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 的業務模式主要基於產品銷售和技術服務，其網絡效應非常有限。雖然其經銷商網絡和客戶關係有一定程度的協同作用，但並未形成像社交媒體或市場平台那樣的用戶增長反饋循環。產品的價值主要取決於其自身性能和可靠性，而非用戶數量或互動。","comment_en":"Hubbell's business model, primarily based on product sales and technical services, exhibits very limited network effects. While its distributor network and customer relationships offer some synergy, they do not create a user-growth feedback loop akin to social media or marketplaces. The value of its products is largely determined by their inherent performance and reliability, not by user numbers or interactions."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"作為一家大型工業設備製造商，Hubbell 受益於顯著的規模經濟效應。其龐大的生產規模、全球採購能力以及優化的供應鏈管理，使其能夠在生產成本上相較於小型競爭對手具有明顯優勢。這不僅提高了其盈利能力，也使其能夠在價格競爭中保持靈活性，並支持其持續的研發和擴張。","comment_en":"As a large industrial equipment manufacturer, Hubbell benefits significantly from economies of scale. Its substantial production volume, global sourcing capabilities, and optimized supply chain management provide a distinct cost advantage over smaller competitors. This enhances profitability, allows pricing flexibility in competitive markets, and supports ongoing R&D and expansion efforts."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 在全球範圍內擁有廣泛的銷售網絡和生產基地，這使其能夠服務於不同地區的客戶並應對區域性市場需求。然而，其地理佈局並非構成獨特的、難以複製的資產壁壘。大多數工業設備製造商都致力於建立全球化運營，Hubbell 的地理優勢更多體現在運營效率和市場覆蓋的廣度上，而非稀缺性。","comment_en":"Hubbell possesses an extensive global sales network and manufacturing footprint, enabling it to serve diverse regional markets and customer needs. However, this geographic presence does not constitute a unique, irreplicable asset barrier. Most industrial equipment manufacturers strive for global operations, and Hubbell's geographic advantage lies more in operational efficiency and market reach breadth than in scarcity."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 在運營效率方面表現出色，體現在其持續優化的生產流程、精益管理以及對成本控制的嚴格把控。其高 ROE 和 ROA 數據（23.0% 和 7.6%）以及穩健的 F-Score（6/9）均印證了其卓越的運營管理能力。這種效率不僅提升了盈利能力，也使其能夠更有效地應對市場波動和競爭壓力。","comment_en":"Hubbell demonstrates strong operational efficiency through continuously optimized production processes, lean management, and rigorous cost controls. Its high ROE (23.0%) and ROA (7.6%), along with a solid F-Score (6/9), attest to its excellent operational management. This efficiency enhances profitability and enables effective navigation of market volatility and competitive pressures."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 在資本配置方面展現出審慎和有效的策略。公司歷史上通過戰略性收購擴張業務，同時也注重有機增長和股東回報（如股息和股票回購）。其穩健的自由現金流（FCF TTM $901.4M）為其提供了充足的彈性來進行再投資、償還債務或回饋股東。管理層在平衡增長機會與風險控制方面表現出較高的水準。","comment_en":"Hubbell exhibits a prudent and effective capital allocation strategy. Historically, it has expanded through strategic acquisitions while also focusing on organic growth and shareholder returns via dividends and buybacks. Its robust Free Cash Flow (FCF TTM $901.4M) provides ample flexibility for reinvestment, debt repayment, or shareholder distributions. Management demonstrates a high level of skill in balancing growth opportunities with risk management."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 的客戶保留率相對較高，這得益於其產品質量、可靠性以及與客戶建立的長期合作關係。在工業領域，尤其是在關鍵基礎設施和長期項目中，客戶更看重供應商的穩定性和產品的耐久性，而非僅僅是短期價格。Hubbell 通過提供優質的產品和服務，有效鎖定了其客戶群體。","comment_en":"Hubbell enjoys relatively high customer retention, driven by product quality, reliability, and established long-term relationships. In the industrial sector, particularly for critical infrastructure and long-term projects, customers prioritize supplier stability and product durability over short-term pricing. By delivering high-quality products and services, Hubbell effectively secures its customer base."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Hubbell 的產品廣泛應用於電力基礎設施、建築和工業領域，這些市場的需求相對穩定且具有一定的週期性韌性。儘管面臨技術變革的挑戰，但其核心產品（如電氣連接、保護設備）在可預見的未來仍將是必需品。公司通過持續的產品升級和對新興領域（如電動汽車充電基礎設施）的佈局，努力維持其業務的長期可持續性。","comment_en":"Hubbell's products serve essential sectors like power infrastructure, construction, and general industry, markets with relatively stable and resilient demand. Despite technological evolution, its core offerings (electrical connections, protection devices) remain necessities for the foreseeable future. Through continuous product upgrades and expansion into emerging areas like EV charging infrastructure, the company strives to maintain long-term business durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Hubbell 展現出一個典型的工業設備製造商的護城河結構，其優勢主要體現在規模經濟帶來的成本優勢（M5）、卓越的運營效率（M7）以及相對較高的客戶轉換成本（M3）。品牌（M1）和專利技術（M2）提供了一定的定價權和競爭壁壘，但並非絕對壟斷。網絡效應（M4）幾乎不存在。其業務模式更接近於一個高效運轉的“收費橋”，通過提供關鍵的、可靠的工業零部件來獲取穩定的利潤。管理層的資本配置能力（M8）和客戶保留率（M9）進一步鞏固了其競爭地位。整體而言，Hubbell 擁有堅固但非無懈可擊的護城河，其價值在於持續的運營卓越和在關鍵工業領域的穩固地位。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Hubbell exhibits a moat structure typical of an industrial equipment manufacturer, with strengths primarily in cost advantages from economies of scale (M5), operational efficiency (M7), and relatively high switching costs (M3). Its brand (M1) and patents (M2) offer some pricing power and barriers, though not absolute monopolies. Network effects (M4) are minimal. The business model resembles an efficiently operated 'toll bridge,' generating stable profits by providing essential, reliable industrial components. Management's capital allocation (M8) and customer retention (M9) further solidify its competitive position. Overall, Hubbell possesses a solid, though not impenetrable, moat, deriving value from consistent operational excellence and a strong foothold in critical industrial sectors.","evidenceHash":"b405c0c209cd7a7fff980c146959358079f610b9ad25e7c8ffd3222a5e9530d1","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":6,"checkedAt":null}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/HUBB.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/HUBB.png","website":"https://www.hubbell.com","ceo":"Gerben Wilhelm Marinus Bakker","full_time_employees":"19400","description":"Hubbell, Inc. engages in the designing, manufacturing, and sale of electrical and electronic products for non-residential and residential construction, industrial, and utility applications. It operates through the Electrical Solutions and Utility Solutions segments. The Electrical Solutions segment manufactures and sells wiring and electrical, lighting fixtures, and controls for indoor and outdoor applications as well as specialty lighting and communications products. The Utility Solutions segment is involved in the design, manufacture, and sale of electrical distribution, transmission, substation, and telecommunications products. The company was founded by Harvey Hubbell II in 1888 and is headquartered in Shelton, CT.","description_en":"Hubbell, Inc. engages in the designing, manufacturing, and sale of electrical and electronic products for non-residential and residential construction, industrial, and utility applications. It operates through the Electrical Solutions and Utility Solutions segments. The Electrical Solutions segment manufactures and sells wiring and electrical, lighting fixtures, and controls for indoor and outdoor applications as well as specialty lighting and communications products. The Utility Solutions segment is involved in the design, manufacture, and sale of electrical distribution, transmission, substation, and telecommunications products. The company was founded by Harvey Hubbell II in 1888 and is headquartered in Shelton, CT.","description_zh":"**Hubbell Incorporated (HUBB) 業務營運精煉分析**\n\nHubbell Incorporated (HUBB) 是一家全球領先的電力與電子產品設計、製造及銷售商，服務對象涵蓋非住宅與住宅建築、工業及公用事業等多元應用領域。公司營運主要劃分為兩大業務板塊：\n\n1.  **電氣解決方案 (Electrical Solutions)**：此部門專注於生產與銷售各式線纜與電氣產品、照明燈具及控制系統，適用於室內外環境。此外，亦提供專業照明與通訊產品。此業務著重於提升建築物與工業設施的電力傳輸效率、照明品質與智慧化控制。\n\n2.  **公用事業解決方案 (Utility Solutions)**：此部門致力於電力傳輸、配電、變電站及電信基礎設施相關產品的設計、製造與銷售。其產品組合旨在確保電力系統的穩定運行、安全傳輸以及通訊網路的可靠性，是支撐現代化電力網與通訊基礎建設的關鍵環節。\n\nHubbell 以其深厚的技術實力與廣泛的產品線，在電力基礎設施與建築電氣化領域扮演重要角色，透過創新產品與解決方案，滿足客戶對安全、效率與可靠性的嚴格要求。","address":"40 Waterview Drive","city":"Shelton","state":"CT","zip":"06484","country":"US","phone":"475 882 4000","full_address":"40 Waterview Drive, Shelton, CT 06484, US","range_52w":"403.82-565.5","year_high":565.5,"year_low":403.82,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":403.82,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Mikes Mark Eugene","title":"officer: EVP, Pres Electrical Solutions","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":1133,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-17","name":"Mikes Mark Eugene","title":"officer: EVP, Pres Electrical Solutions","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":4273,"price":441.21,"total_val":1.89},{"date":"2026-08-18","name":"LIND BONNIE CRUICKSHANK","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":65,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-18","name":"KEATING NEAL J.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":31,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-18","name":"Guzzi Anthony","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":76,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-13","name":"DEL NERO JONATHAN M.","title":"officer: Vice President, Controller","is_buy":false,"action":"S-Sale","shares":547,"price":518.56,"total_val":0.28},{"date":"2026-07-08","name":"Mikes Mark Eugene","title":"officer: President Electrical Solutions","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":207,"price":494.28,"total_val":0.1},{"date":"2026-07-08","name":"Gumbs Gregory","title":"officer: President, Utility Solutions","is_buy":null,"action":"F-InKind","shares":415,"price":494.28,"total_val":0.21},{"date":"2026-05-19","name":"LIND BONNIE CRUICKSHANK","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":68,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-05-19","name":"KEATING NEAL J.","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":32,"price":0,"total_val":0}],"stock_splits":[{"date":"1996-08-12","ratio":"2 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1995-01-09","ratio":"21 : 20","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1992-01-06","ratio":"21 : 20","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1991-01-07","ratio":"21 : 20","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1990-01-08","ratio":"21 : 20","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1989-01-09","ratio":"21 : 20","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1985-08-12","ratio":"2 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1981-02-11","ratio":"2 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1980-02-11","ratio":"2 : 1","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"},{"date":"1977-08-08","ratio":"4 : 3","desc":"供應商報告的股數調整比例；未獨立核實事件類型。","type":"FMP 股數調整"}],"fmp_symbol":"HUBB","real_5y_prices":[],"historical_dcf_series":[],"name_en":"Hubbell Incorporated","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-10-22T13:47:16.997Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/HUBB.json"}},"snapshot":null,"model":null}
